  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Whole original animal, armoured body and sharply tapering toothless snout tip. [\"Large portions of postcranial material lost; carapace outline is reconstruction.\", \"Skin, colour, webbing extent, live body volume inferred; artwork not direct fossil evidence.\", \"Only front snout toothless, not entire mouth.\"] {\"total_length_m\": 0.9, \"skull_length_m\": 0.15, \"basis\": \"Sea Rex educator guide2010 page14 authored Jouve/Vincent/Bardet; reconstruction estimates, not exact complete specimen measurements.\", \"carapace_length_width_ratio\": 1.4, \"ratio_basis\": \"PE2010 table1 explicitly interpretation from Jaekel1907 plate10, NOT fossil measurement.\"}",
    "zh": "原创低多边形研究；形态、尺度及不确定性严格以本次已核参考为界。原始限定：Whole original animal, armoured body and sharply tapering toothless snout tip. [\"Large portions of postcranial material lost; carapace outline is reconstruction.\", \"Skin, colour, webbing extent, live body volume inferred; artwork not direct fossil evidence.\", \"Only front snout toothless, not entire mouth.\"] {\"total_length_m\": 0.9, \"skull_length_m\": 0.15, \"basis\": \"Sea Rex educator guide2010 page14 authored Jouve/Vincent/Bardet; reconstruction estimates, not exact complete specimen measurements.\", \"carapace_length_width_ratio\": 1.4, \"ratio_basis\": \"PE2010 table1 explicitly interpretation from Jaekel1907 plate10, NOT fossil measurement.\"}"
